4,3927,Fuva Brain Limited,データベース,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,42.0,44.0,Technology,Software - Infrastructure,https://www.fuva-brain.co.jp,"Fuva Brain Limited engages in the development and sale of cyber security solutions in Japan. The company offers gateway network, endpoint security, and human security; provides Eye 247 safety zone, a multi layered security product that combine endpoint security and firewall; ASH series, a safety measure software; SecureSphere, integrated security solution for web applications and database servers; App Earth, cloud based distributed denial-of-service protection; SASE platform that simplifies traditional, complex security measures, creating a secure and efficient network environment; network blackbox. It also offers Eye  247  Spam Shield; Reboot Guard; DualLink Guard; Crystal Protection, a security cloud service that allows for centralized management of external threat countermeasures and internal fraud countermeasures; Eye 247 Work Smart cloud, a business process visualization tool designed to improve productivity and covering everything from labor management to information leakage; Eye 247 Work Smart Server, a model file server for small and medium-sized businesses; Eye 247 AntiMalware for integrated protection from two malware protection engines. In addition, the company offers recruitment consulting, paid employment placement services, planning, production and operation of web content, internet advertising agency services based on research data, operation of internet research systems, and education and training seminars. Further, it engages in the planning, research, development, production and sales of system software; production and sales of software and hardware; IT personnel dispatch and outsourcing services; SI business; investment business; contract development; and educational business. The company was formerly known as Ahkun Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Fuva Brain Limited in October 2018. Fuva Brain Limited was inc