4,3933,"CHIeru Co.,Ltd.",IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,94.0,96.0,Technology,Software - Application,https://www.chieru.com,"CHIeru Co.,Ltd. engages in the production of ICT environments for teaching and learning in schools in Japan and internationally. It operates through three segments: Elementary School and Junior High School Division; High School and University Division; and Corporate and Government Sectors. The company's services include software and system products, teaching and learning resources, and strategic consulting for school ICT environments in primary and higher education. It offers InterCLASS Cloud, a web-based classroom management software, that facilitates collaborative learning using Google Workspace for Education; CaLabo EX, a computer-assisted digital language lab solution system, that supports all types of teaching materials; Tbridge, improves network bottlenecks with patented technology; and GLEXA, a learning system that offers e-learning features. The company was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan. CHIeru Co.,Ltd. is a joint venture of Alps System Integration Co., Ltd. and Obunsha Co., Ltd.",ok,https://www.chieru.com,"CHIeru | CHIeru, an educational support company that utilizes ICT Products About Us Contact JAPANESE We at CHIeru are for the future of our children. We support teachers’ classroom teaching around the world with ICT. Installed in over 60% of schools in Japan with growing use in 20 other countries In Japan, CHIeru's premium quality interactive teaching solutions are in use in most schools in Japan — they are also gaining popularity globally. Promoting University DX with Hybrid Language Lectures, Both Online and in CALL Classrooms Strongly support for Chromebook usage in One-To-One devices environment Dramatically improves network bottlenecks with patented technology An all-in-one campus platform connecting teachers and students TOP Products About Us Contact CHIeru Co., Ltd. is one of the largest educational technology solution providers in Japan. ©2022 Google LLC All rights reserved. Google, Chromebook, Chrome OS and Google Chrome are trademarks of Google LLC. Contact: overseas@chieru.co.jp +81-3-6712-9721 CHIeru Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. Products About Us Contact +81-3-6712-9721 overseas@chieru.co.jp Language JAPANESE",pending_chatgpt_review,,,,,,
