4,3964,Aucnet Inc.,サブスクリプション,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,8.0,5.0,Consumer Cyclical,Internet Retail,https://www.aucnet.co.jp,"Aucnet Inc., a circular market design company, engages in online auctions and various distribution businesses for goods, flowers, used motorcycles, used medical equipment, and other products in Japan. The company operates through Lifestyle Products and Mobility & Energy segments. It is involved in used motorcycle and flower auctions and circular commerce business; fashion resale business; agricultural business, such as cut and potted flowers; and digital devices, such as used PCs and mobile phones. The company was formerly known as FTS Inc. and changed its name to Aucnet Inc. in September 1984. Aucnet Inc. was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan.",home_unavailable,https://www.aucnet.co.jp,,pending_chatgpt_review,,,,,,
4,3965,"Capital Asset Planning, Inc.",IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,94.0,86.0,Technology,Software - Application,https://www2.cap-net.co.jp,"Capital Asset Planning, Inc. provides system integration services in Japan and internationally. It offers application systems for life insurance companies, including insurance design/application issuing systems, RPA systems for the insurance sales process, and the construction of customer relationship management systems, as well as life planning, public pension calculation, retirement simulation systems, and inheritance and property succession construction services. The company also provides systems for banks and securities companies, such as an asset management platform that enables future simulations of portfolios with individually selected stocks, wealth management platform systems that automate and streamline inheritance, business succession, and property succession, consulting services, a contribution pension management app, and fund wrap simulations using robo-advisors, which support the automation of international diversification and asset management. In addition, it offers Wealth Management Workstation (WMW), an integrated asset management system in the cloud computing environment, and estate planning services for wealthy individuals using WMW. Further, the company provides a private banking and financial planning education business consisting of portfolio theory, life insurance theory, real estate business, and tax law, etc. Capital Asset Planning, Inc. was incorporated in 1990 and is headquartered in Kita, Japan.",home_unavailable,https://www2.cap-net.co.jp,,pending_chatgpt_review,,,,,,
