4,3984,"User Local, Inc.",IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,94.0,98.0,Technology,Information Technology Services,https://www.userlocal.jp,"User Local, Inc. engages in data cloud business in Japan. The company offers User Insight, a web analytics tool for businesses that supports heat maps; Social Insight, a marketing analysis and management tool for social media; User Local ChatAI, a tool that allows users to use generative AI; and Support Chatbot, a tool that responds to customer inquiries in real time on portal sites and internal chat tools. It also provides Text Mining that analyzes word occurrence rates and sentiment in texts; Automated Summarization Tool that analyzes the structure and summarizes the important parts of the text; Emotion Recognition AI used to extract emotions from text; Future Prediction AI used to predict the future based on past data; Facial Recognition AI for identifying the location of faces in a photo and determines the number of people, age, and gender; Automotive Image Processing AI for blurring the background and license plate from a car image; AI Comment System which supports media operations; Personal Information Anonymization Filter which removes and highlights personal information from the text; and Duplicate Counting Tool that calculates the union, intersection, and difference of two lists. In addition, the company is involved in the research, development, and provision of big data analysis systems and AI systems. User Local, Inc. was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan.",ok,https://www.userlocal.jp | https://www.userlocal.jp/products/ | https://www.userlocal.jp/company/,"株式会社ユーザーローカル English ホーム サービス サービス一覧 User Insight Social Insight サポートチャットボット ChatAI AIテキストマイニング 導入事例 プレスリリース IR サステナビリティ 採用 新卒採用 企業情報 企業情報 トップ 会社情報 アクセス ビジョンとバリュー 経営陣紹介 沿革 お問い合わせ ログイン EN 法人向け生成AIプラットフォーム 「ユーザーローカル ChatAI」無償提供中 【2026年12月末まで】 生成AIを安全・簡単にビジネス利用可能 詳しく見る ビッグデータ×人工知能で 世界を進化させる ビッグデータ・人工知能（AI）などのテクノロジーを駆使したツールで 国内大手企業を中心とした5,000社以上のビジネスをサポート