4,4020,Betrend Corporation,IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,90.0,82.0,Technology,Software - Application,https://www.betrend.com,"Betrend Corporation provides SaaS CRM services in Japan. The company offers betrend, a smart CRM system that allows companies to distribute information to customers using smartphones and mobile phones; and LINE Mini App, a web service. It also provides email marketing, call centers, customization, SMS delivery, and membership card services, as well as engages in the printing and delivering of postcards and other paper products. The company serves restaurants, retailers, and service providers. It provides its services through direct sales and agency sales. Betrend Corporation was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Shinagawa, Japan.",ok,https://www.betrend.com,ビートレンド株式会社 コーポレートサイト｜店舗販促のスマートCRM,pending_chatgpt_review,,,,,,
