g-term and make in-app purchases. Learn More UA for idle tower defense game GameDuo used Appier's Ad Cloud for in-app data, forming new user profiles and leveraging AI for targeting during the campaign, resulting in a remarkable 41% ",pending_chatgpt_review,,,,,,
