4,4308,J-Stream Inc.,IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,58.0,56.0,Communication Services,Entertainment,https://www.stream.co.jp,"J-Stream Inc., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the internet video distribution business in Japan. It offers video and audio content through the internet, including music, movies, event videos, corporate presentations, educational videos, and advertisements; video production, such as content planning, video recording and editing, and direction of internet live events; audio recording; website construction; and encoding, as well as operations-related services. The company also provides various services comprising video AX for explanatory works; video streaming system; live streaming; video e-learning; webinar; content delivery network; server/site security/content protection; advertising and web marketing support; video and web production, as well as system development; and video streaming related services. In addition, it is involved in the development and operation of content sales sites and other platforms; provision of member authentication platform; website creation; operational support; development of programs and applications that integrate with various databases; import, development, and sale of digital broadcasting equipment; video transmission and distribution system integration; content creation and management for closed loop marketing in the pharmaceutical industry; cloud services; development and provision of video manual SaaS; computer software development; and technical personnel dispatch and outsourcing business. The company was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan.",ok,https://www.stream.co.jp | https://www.stream.co.jp/service/ | https://www.stream.co.jp/service/live/live/,"Ｊストリーム - 動画ソリューションの活用でお客さまの課題を解決する ニュース IR情報 株主の皆様へ 経営方針 最新IR情報 適時開示情報 決算短信 有価証券報告書等 決算説明会 株主総会 株式情報 電子公告 IRカレンダー パートナー募集 パートナー制度・パートナープログラム Equipmedia（EQ）パートナー制度 ミテシルパートナー制度 CDNextパートナープログラム パートナー パートナーについて 採用情報 Jストリーム採用サイト 関連サイト 動