4,431A,"uSonar Co., Ltd.",IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,94.0,96.0,Technology,Information Technology Services,https://usonar.co.jp,"uSonar Co., Ltd. engages in the development of a corporate database, ""LBC,"" that offers B2B data. The company operates a customer data integration solution platform, ""Usonar,"" that provides information on capital affiliations and headquarters/business unit relationships, as well as list extraction considering news, implemented services, and website visit data. It provides mSonar, a business information and business card management application and Plansonar, a management strategy platform. It offers customer data integration solution for corporate activities including marketing and management. The company was formerly known as Landscape Co., Ltd. and changed its name to uSonar Co., Ltd. in July 2022. The company was incorporated in 1990 and is based in Shinjuku, Japan.",home_unavailable,https://usonar.co.jp,,pending_chatgpt_review,,,,,,
