4,4396,System Support Holdings Inc.,IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,97.0,100.0,Technology,Information Technology Services,https://www.sts-hd.co.jp,"System Support Holdings Inc., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the planning, development, operation, and maintenance of IT systems in Japan and North America. The company operates in five segments: Cloud Integration Business, System Integration Business, Outsourcing Business, Product Business, and Overseas Business. It offers technical support for migration and use of cloud services, as well as resale of licenses for ServiceNow, Microsoft Azure, Amazon Web Services, and Google Cloud; introduction and use of ERP packages, infrastructure construction of Oracle database, and IT system consulting, design, development, operation and maintenance; and private cloud and other data center services, data analysis and input, and nearshore system operation and maintenance. The company also develops, customizes, and sells software products, including Tate Yakusha, a construction work information management system; Shugyo Yakusha, an attendance and work management system; SHIFTEE, a cloud-based shift management system; MOS, a mobile ordering system; T-File System, a medical image management and filing system; and PinMap that provides customer information mapping services. In addition, it is involved in overseas system integration, payroll and accounting outsourcing, recruitment services, and media management. The company was formerly known as System Support Inc. and changed its name to System Support Holdings Inc. in January 2025. System Support Holdings Inc. was incorporated in 1980 and is headquartered in Kanazawa, Japan.",ok,https://www.sts-hd.co.jp | https://www.sts-hd.co.jp/about/overview/ | https://www.sts-hd.co.jp/about/business/,"株式会社システムサポートホールディングス 株式会社システムサポートホールディングス トップページ 企業・グループ情報 企業・グループ情報 トップメッセージ 会社概要 役員紹介 事業紹介 グループ会社 IR情報 IR情報 IRニュース 経営方針・戦略 業績・財務情報 IRライブラリー 株主・株式関連情報 個人投資家の皆様へ IRカレンダー よくあるご質問 IRお問い合わせ 免責事項 サステナビリ