4,4432,WingArc1st Inc.,IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,90.0,82.0,Technology,Software - Application,https://www.wingarc.com/en/,"WingArc1st Inc. provides software and services in Japan. The company offers SVF products for form design and form output that comprises Form Design, which defines the layout of forms and creates form files; Interface, which connects host systems and the output engine that acts as the main body of SVF; and Form Output, which is the engine that combines form definitions and analyzed data to output forms. It also provides SVF Cloud, a cloud form service; document management platforms, including invoiceAgent documents document management solution and invoiceAgent AI OCR form digitization solution; and Dr.Sum, a data analysis platform for integrating and utilizing data. In addition, the company offers MotionBoard, a data app platform for market share and customer satisfaction; and VyNDEX, an app to streamline Salesforce data maintenance. WingArc1st Inc. was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan.",ok,https://www.wingarc.com/en/ | https://www.wingarc.com/en/product/svf/lineup/index.html | https://www.wingarc.com/en/product/svf/index.html,"WingArc1st Inc. MENU CLOSE Products Products and services Form creation / output / management SVF Product list System requirements SVF Cloud What is SVF Cloud? SVF Cloud for Salesforce Document management platform invoiceAgent Documents invoiceAgent AI OCR System requirements Database engine / reporting Dr.Sum Features System requirements Data analysis / visualization MotionBoard / MotionBoard Cloud Features System requirements Salesforce data editing service VyNDEX Services and support General inquiries User User support Customer Success About WingArc1st Contact us Search Language JP English 中文 Our Picks Products and Services Business form utilization Business form solution By centralizing the business form system, you can achieve internal control through trail management, quick response to business changes and cost reduction. Cloud form service SVF Cloud can be integrated with various systems and cloud services, which can realize highly convenient and smooth business form management. Document management platform By digitizing, managing, distributing, and replying to all documents in one place, it promotes paperless and enhanced corporate governance. Data utilization Data analysis solution Dr.Sum consolidates a large amount of data across a company. The database engine, user interface, and data integration tool are provided as an all-in-one product. Data utilization platform You can visualize and analyze data with graphical expression and take the next action based on the analysis. You can use MotionBoard as a business application with the data entry functions. Salesforce data editing service You can retrieve, update, add, and delete Salesforce data in Excel format. A large amount of data can be updated at once, which improves your productivity greatly. News All Product information Corporate Information IR View more news WingArc1st Footer Product list SVF SVF Cloud TOP SVF Cloud SVF Cloud for Salesforce invoiceAgent Documents invoiceAgent AI OCR Dr.Sum MotionBoard VyNDEX Support / Service Customer Success Site Product License Agreements Sample Gallery Sample Gallery TOP How to use Terms of use Site map Contact us Go to corporate website Information security governance Security policy Site policy Privacy policy Privacy policy for specific personal information Basic policy on countering antisocial forces Copyright © WingArc1st Inc. All Rights Reserved. Back to Top Software to improve business efficiency SVF product list｜WingArc1st Inc. MENU CLOSE Products Products and services Form creation / output / management SVF Product list System requirements SVF Cloud What is SVF Cloud? SVF Cloud for Salesforce Document management platform invoiceAgent Documents invoiceAgent AI OCR System requirements Database engine / reporting Dr.Sum Features System requirements Data analysi