4,4439,"Toumei Co.,Ltd.",脱炭素,GX・エネルギー,,unknown,8.0,5.0,Industrials,Conglomerates,https://www.toumei.co.jp,"Toumei Co.,Ltd. offers telecommunications services in Japan. The company operates through three segments: Office Hikari 119 Business, Office Solution Business, and Financial Planning Business. The Office Hikari 119 Business segment provides services related to the office communication environment, including optical fiber lines and internet service providers; and services related to communication infrastructure, such as the establishment of landline telephones and internet lines, installation of Wi-Fi hotspots, and review of DX services and communication environments. This segment also operates call centers, customer centers, billing collection departments, etc. The Office Solution Business segment offers energy solutions, consisting of the retail sale of electricity; office environment solutions comprising of business phones, unified threat management equipment, PCs, servers, network-compatible multifunctional devices, LED lighting equipment, and commercial air conditioners; and web solutions, such as renting corporate PR websites and creating websites, as well as manages and sells solar power generation systems and storage batteries. The Financial Planning Business provides insurance brokerage services under Hoken Minaoshi Honpo store. The company serves small and medium-sized businesses, and individual business owners. The company was formerly known as Tomei Mie and changed its name to Tomei Co.,Ltd. in 2001. Tomei Co.,Ltd. was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Yokkaichi, Japan.",ok,https://www.toumei.co.jp | https://www.toumei.co.jp/company/ | https://www.toumei.co.jp/company/profile/,"株式会社東名｜中小企業の課題を解決するパートナー オンライン商談 企業情報 CORPORATE 企業情報TOP 代表メッセージ 企業理念 会社概要 役員紹介 沿革 CSR アライアンス BRAND MOVIE 企業ポリシー サービス情報 SERVICE サービス情報TOP 光回線インターネット インターネットプロバイダ ドメインサービス ネットワークセキュリティ 業務用エアコン 電気 Webサイト制作 来店型保険ショップ ニュース NEWS IR情報 IR IR情報TOP IRニュース IRライブラリー 業績・財務ハイライト 