株式情報 中期経営計画2028 IR note 株主優待制度 採用情報 新着情報一覧 お問い合わせ HOME > For Investors For Investors TOBILA SYSTEMS We aim to solve social issues through technology. Company Overview IR Library Operating Results IR Calendar Inquiry Who We Are Corporate Philosophy CEO Message Service Overview Company Profile For New Investors Who We Are We leverage technology to solve social issues and provide services to eradicate special fraud (phone scams/wire transfer fraud) , phishing scams, and gray zone crimes (activities that exploit legal loopholes or are ethically questionable despite not being explicitly prohibited by law) . Our “Fraud and Spam Prevention Service” collects and investigates information related to fraudulent calls and SMS messages to build a database that automatically filters such threats. It is deployed on mobile devices, landline phones, and business phones, and is used by approximately 15 million people each month. Corporate Philosophy and Guiding Principles Corporate Philosophy We open the door to a better future for our lives and the world Using technologies for the challenge of solving social issues * Tobila (meaning ‘door’ in Japanese) Systems is dedicated to opening doors to secure communication and a safer digital world. Guiding Principles We are constantly changing without fear of failure and challenging conventional thinking to realize a better future for which we dream. We will be a source of products that help solve social issues and benefit people. We will also pursue appropriate earnings for sustainable steady growth as we expand and upgrade our operations. We believe that maintaining an environment where we can live in peace with our loved ones will directly lead to our growth and a better life for people worldwide. CEO Message Atsushi Akita Representative Director and President Modern society, while benefiting from technologica",pending_chatgpt_review,,,,,,
