4,4443,"Sansan, Inc.",IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,90.0,92.0,Technology,Software - Application,https://www.corp-sansan.com,"Sansan, Inc. engages in the planning, development, and selling of cloud-based solutions in Japan. The company offers Sansan, a cloud-based solution that manages business cards and contacts, and company information, as well as sales history, enabling the sharing of this data companywide to increase net sales while reducing costs; Bill One, a cloud-based solution to receive and digitizes all invoices; Contract One, a digitally transforming solution; AskOne, a multichannel form that collects customer feedback from all touchpoints and supports continuous improvements in customer experience; and Eight, a business card app for contacts and career movements. It also provides logmi Biz, Finance, and Tech, an event transcription service that logs complete transcriptions of press conferences, events, and interviews and delivers information to the audience. Sansan, Inc. was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",ok,https://www.corp-sansan.com | https://www.corp-sansan.com/service | https://www.corp-sansan.com/company,"Sansan, Inc. News Service Technology Company Company Top Our Profile Our Philosophy Leaders Access Investor Relations Investor Relations Top IR News Management Information Financial Information IR Materials Stock Information For New Investors IR Calendar IR Site Map IR Policy External Evaluations FAQ Disclaimer Sustainability Sustainability Top Sustainability News CEO Commitment Sustainability Management Environment Society Governance ESG Data Comparison Table NEXT – CSV Initiatives Careers Japanese Watch video Sansan The sales AX solution that centralizes data such as business cards and contacts, online activity, and meeting history to build a unique database shareable company-wide. AI can then be leveraged to maximize that data for increasing revenue and reducing costs. Bill One The accounting AX solution that applies AI an