4,446A,"Northsand, Inc.",IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,72.0,68.0,Industrials,Consulting Services,https://northsand.co.jp,"Northsand, Inc. provides IT consulting, business consulting, and new business launch services for companies in Japan. The company's services include IT consulting, business consulting, digital consulting, project management, and in-house services. The company's business consulting services include marketing, sales, human resources, business improvement, strategy formulation, and implementation support. It uses digital marketing, data platform construction, and machine learning to provides digital consulting services. Additionally, it provides IT consulting services including IT strategy and corporate areas, implementation and operations areas, including formulating mid-term IT plans, examining architecture design, and reducing IT operating costs. It also offers support for project management, operation, and execution. Additionally, it provides in-house services for a wide range of fields through agency and license agreements. The company uses digital technologies, such as IoT, AI, Fintech, and big data, legacy technologies for digital strategy planning. It also offers comprehensive training and development programs. Additionally, it provides Notion, a centralized information management tool. The company provides consulting services across a wide range of industries and sectors including self-service beer servers and fitness, finance, manufacturing, human resources, and communications. Northsand, Inc. was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Chuo, Tokyo, Japan.",ok,https://northsand.co.jp | https://northsand.co.jp/company/ | https://northsand.co.jp/service/,"株式会社ノースサンド - 世界をデザインする 〚 〛 MENU 〚 〛 COMPANY COMPANY 会社情報 会社概要、役員紹介など、組織の基本情報を掲載しております。 PHILOSOPHY PHILOSOPHY フィロソフィー 私たちが大切にしている想いや価値観をご紹介しております。 SERVICE SERVICE サービス 提供しているサービスやソリューションの内容、強み、対応領域などを紹介するページです。 RECRUIT RECRUIT 採用情報 募集職種や働く環境、選考プロセスなど、採用に関する情報を掲載しております。 IR IR IR情報 投資家の方向けに、業績や株式情報などをま